{"id":"entonces","lemma":"entonces","pos":"adv","rank":67,"glosses":["then, next, thereupon, at that time, at that point","then, therefore, so, thus; in that case"],"ipa":"/enˈtonθes/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-entonces.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo era feliz entonces.","en":"I was happy then.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442639"},{"text":"¿Entonces ahora qué hago?","en":"So what do I do now?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/731895"},{"text":"¿Entonces qué hacemos ahora?","en":"So what do we do now?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453386"},{"text":"¿Y entonces que pasó?","en":"And then what happened?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458655"},{"text":"¿Habrás terminado para entonces?","en":"Can you finish by then?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460919"}]}